  "stageId": "main_00-07",
  "title": "感染",
  "storyCode": "0-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6565c8097de5c37eb2e7442bef1bcde3e7ad98a3778caf0f9855151365acae7d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "依照既定路线，我们已经很接近切城南边的中城区了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "穿过这个公园，就是汇合点。不出意外的话，临光和E4小队应该已经在那里等着我们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "要是临光......被袭击了，会怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "要是他们原本想用通讯设施警告我们，却发现信号遭到干扰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "我们该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我们会去确认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "我们要亲眼确认事件之后，才会做出揣测。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "不要用怀疑恐吓自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "明，明白了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "失去联络手段所带来的恐慌情绪，比想象中蔓延得快得多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "特别是......在这个天灾仿佛近在眼前的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "我们得赶紧加快速度了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "欸......这阵雾气......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——难道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "小心！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "干掉他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "敌军的射击！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "这是陷阱......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "————！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "不好，我们的后方也出现了整合运动的追兵......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "侦查干员呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "被战场分割了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "罗德岛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "追上你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "杀！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "这次，就让你们粉身碎骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "杜宾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "狙击干员！压制敌人的冲锋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "重装干员，防御姿态，随时准备向前顶上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Ace，准备————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "等一下，等一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "在清剿了东南要塞之后，我一听到你的消息，可是立刻就赶过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "这里已经是我的处理范围咯，弑君者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "你来做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "该把他们，交给我了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
